    ["红月被遮蔽的深沉黑夜里，嘉德丽雅的面前。\n心灵巨龙的恐怖吐息，几乎在瞬间洞穿了这位半神的精神！\n——但嘉德丽雅还活着。\n那张绯红的纸人如同凝结的月光。\n它只在最危险的那一刻，承担那致命的一击。\n然后留下微微发冷的身体，提醒着那擦肩而过的死亡。"] = "In the deep night when the red moon was obscured, before Cattleya. \n The terrifying breath of the Mind Dragon pierced through this Demigod's spirit in an instant! \n —But Cattleya was still alive. \n That crimson paper figurine was like congealed moonlight. \n It only bore that fatal blow at the most dangerous moment. \n Then it left behind a slightly cold body, reminding her of the death that had brushed past.",
