    ["获得该神奇物品后，将获得格斗学者序列的扮演技能。\n一副古铜色眼镜，镜片呈淡金色，边框刻有猎隼和锋利爪子的浮雕。佩戴时视野会略微缩窄，但所有人影似乎被分割成不同色块与流动线条。"] = "After obtaining this mystical item, you will gain the Acting Skill of the Fighting Scholar Sequence. \n A pair of antique bronze glasses with pale gold lenses and frames engraved with reliefs of a hunting falcon and sharp claws. When worn, the field of vision narrows slightly, but all silhouettes appear to be divided into different color blocks and flowing lines.",
