    ["通用QTE  玩家播放指定镜头后效  失败后延时重新执行当前任务步骤  "] = "General QTE. Player plays specified camera effect. If failed, delay and re-execute the current quest step.",
    ["那块太阳很轻，就像一片羽毛的重量，但却点亮了她的整个梦。"] = "That piece of the sun was very light, like the weight of a feather, but it lit up her entire dream.",
    ["邮件《%s》已过期，系统已自动删除。"] = "Mail \"%s\" has expired and has been automatically deleted by the system.",
    ["采集指定TemplateID的采集物  玩家发送任务道具  玩家播放仅自己可见的说话文本  延迟执行  玩家播放仅自己可见的说话文本  延迟执行  玩家播放仅自己可见的说话文本  "] = "Gather the specified TemplateID collection item; player sends quest item; player plays speech text visible only to themselves; delayed execution; player plays speech text visible only to themselves; delayed execution; player plays speech text visible only to themselves.",
    ["阿兹克将那只手套递给克莱恩时，他看见掌心裂开了一张嘴，白森森的牙齿在虚空中咬合。\n“它很强大，”阿兹克说，“但每次使用后，必须用一个活人的灵魂和血肉喂饱它。”\n克莱恩接过手套，感到一股永远无法填平的饥饿。\n那天晚上，他写下誓言：“我只放牧罪孽深重之人，我承诺让原本放牧的灵魂得到解脱。”\n从那以后，格尔曼·斯帕罗的名字开始在海上流传——那个戴着人皮手套的疯狂冒险家，专门猎杀海盗、奴隶贩子和罪犯。\n他解放原本囚禁的可怜灵魂，放牧曾犯下血债的罪孽之人。\n后来，手套在迷雾小镇与A先生融合，开始在克莱恩的脑海中赞美真实造物主。\n“早中晚各一次，”克莱恩拿出一把蘑菇，冷静地说，“赞颂前必须预先提醒。”\n手套剧烈颤抖——它从未想过，有一天会被蘑菇威胁。\n“成交。”\n从此，格尔曼·斯帕罗的口袋里总是装着几颗蘑菇。"] = "When Azik handed that glove to Klein, he saw a mouth split open in the palm, white teeth biting in the void. \n \"It is very powerful,\" Azik said, \"but after every use, it must be fed with the soul and flesh of a living person.\" \n Klein took the glove and felt a hunger that could never be satisfied. \n That night, he wrote a vow: \"I will only shepherd those who have committed grave sins; I promise to let the souls I shepherd find release.\" \n From then on, the name Gehrman Sparrow began to spread on the sea—the crazy adventurer wearing human-skin gloves who specialized in hunting pirates, slave traders, and criminals. \n He liberated the poor souls that were originally imprisoned and shepherded the sinners who had committed blood debts. \n Later, the glove fused with Mr. A in the Fog Town and began to praise the True Creator in Klein's mind. \n \"Once in the morning, noon, and night,\" Klein took out a mushroom and said calmly, \"you must give a warning before praising.\" \n The glove trembled violently—it had never imagined that one day it would be threatened by a mushroom. \n \"Deal.\" \n From then on, Gehrman Sparrow's pocket was always filled with a few mushrooms.",
